# Canonical reviewed solution: directly authored binary, not assembler output.
11111010 # instruction | CLI | Keep the final halt stopped.
10111000 00110100 00010010 # instruction | MOV AX,1234 | Initialize the word to store.
10100011 00000000 00000110 # instruction | MOV [0600],AX | A3 stores low byte 34 at DS:0600 and high byte 12 at DS:0601.
11110100 # instruction | HLT | Stop after the complete little-endian store.
